repository-code: "https://github.com/vumichien/manim-skill"
url: "https://github.com/vumichien/manim-skill"
abstract: >
  Claude Code plugin that turns ideas, papers, and math topics into Manim
  animations via a 4-role agent pipeline (researcher + planner + implementer
  + main). Agent prompts are tuned offline with GEPA against schema/render/
  MathTex/regression metrics.
keywords:
  - manim
  - animation
  - claude-code
  - agent
  - prompt-optimization
  - gepa
  - education
  - research-visualization
